# LOG_055: Ecosystems Win

**Date:** 2026-08-06
**Source:** Field Observation - Platform Strategy
**Tags:** #Ecosystem #Multiplication #Infrastructure #VaultPrinciple

## Observation
The challenge shifts from building technology to getting people to build on top of it. OS, App stores, Road networks, Payment rails.

## Pattern
Great infrastructure creates an environment where others generate value.

## Vault Principle
**Great infrastructure multiplies the capabilities of everyone connected to it.**

## Leverage
Design for composability and extension, not control and ownership.

